{"id":"d3f01e4942d25070","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-minimal-proof-height.md","title":"最小证明高度的部分函数","display":"df-minimal-proof-height — 最小证明高度的部分函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-minimal-proof-height","aliases":["18-df-minimal-proof-height","18-df-042"],"display":"df-minimal-proof-height — 最小证明高度的部分函数","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-height-bound]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-minimal-proof-height"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-minimal-proof-height</span><span>18-df-042</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-proof-height — 最小证明高度的部分函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd8d54af84f6f7dc\" href=\"?note=dd8d54af84f6f7dc\" title=\"18-df-proof-height-bound\">18-df-proof-height-bound</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd8d54af84f6f7dc\" href=\"?note=dd8d54af84f6f7dc\" title=\"18-df-proof-height-bound\">18-df-proof-height-bound</a> 的规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是序数类缩写。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(h_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 仅定义于形式断言给出的域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle s,\\alpha\\rangle:s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S,\\ \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\n\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s,\\ \\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\neg(\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\beta s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle s,\\alpha\\rangle:s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S,\\ \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\n\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s,\\ \\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\;\\neg(\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\beta s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(h_{\\mathcal P})=\n\\{s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S:\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(h_{\\mathcal P})=\n\\{s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S:\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|F|_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq h_{\\mathcal P}(\\langle\\varnothing,\\{F\\}\\rangle)\n\\quad(\\langle\\varnothing,\\{F\\}\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h_{\\mathcal P})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|F|_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq h_{\\mathcal P}(\\langle\\varnothing,\\{F\\}\\rangle)\n\\quad(\\langle\\varnothing,\\{F\\}\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h_{\\mathcal P})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地辅助量，不等同原书 truth complexity。非空序数类的最小值可通过选任一见证 α 后在 α+1 中分离取得；序数良序保证唯一。旧稿未形式化函数域，且把公式直接输入相继式关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-height-bound","status":"resolved","id":"dd8d54af84f6f7dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-height-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-height-bound","status":"resolved","id":"dd8d54af84f6f7dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-height-bound]] 的规则集 $\\mathcal P$。$s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S$；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是序数类缩写。$h_{\\mathcal P}$ 仅定义于形式断言给出的域。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"h_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"h_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle s,\\alpha\\rangle:s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S,\\ \\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\n\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s,\\ \\forall\\beta<\\alpha\\;\\neg(\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\beta s)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(h_{\\mathcal P})=\n\\{s\\in\\mathrm{Seq}_S:\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"|F|_{\\mathcal P}\\coloneqq h_{\\mathcal P}(\\langle\\varnothing,\\{F\\}\\rangle)\n\\quad(\\langle\\varnothing,\\{F\\}\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(h_{\\mathcal P})).","display":true}],"bytes":1540,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-minimal-proof-height]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-minimal-proof-height]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[..